    "Turn this on only if the arguments stop the tool from running commands, editing files, or using other tools of its own. Text in a page could otherwise steer the tool, so until then it gets no page, selection, file, or download data. Arch cannot check this; it only runs the tool in an empty folder with a small environment." : {
